.claude/
.agents/
kb/
openspec/
.github/
templates/
examples/
spaces/
k8s/
server-module/
spacetimedb_module/

# Dev tooling and lockfiles (uv.lock alone is ~868 KB)
uv.lock
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.gitleaks.toml
.hypothesis/
.tools/

# Build and deploy definitions — never read from inside the image. Only two
# images are built from this context: dockerfiles/Dockerfile.vertex (the deployed
# trainer/worker, built by cloudbuild.yaml) and dockerfiles/Dockerfile.inference
# (built by infra/cloudbuild-gameplay.yaml). The four per-role Dockerfiles and
# docker-compose.yml were deleted on 2026-09-02; the orphaned root `Dockerfile`
# (referenced by no build pipeline) on 2026-11-10.
#
# `dockerfiles/` is deliberately NOT listed: excluding the Dockerfile named by
# `-f` is normally harmless, but this is the deployed build and no docker daemon
# was available to prove it here. A few KB in a multi-GB CUDA image is not worth
# the risk.
cloudbuild.yaml
docker-compose*.yml
Makefile
infra/terraform/

# Note on evidence: docs/evidence/ (including tech_debt_baseline/baseline.json)
# is already excluded by the `docs/` rule above — it is committed input to the
# debt-ratchet test, not a runtime artifact.

# Merge/patch leftovers
*.orig
*.rej

